  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The organisation OEF-ES was awarded &#x20ac;12,500 for the implementation of project Food Security for Women and Families in 13 Rural and Marginalised Urban Communities in El Salvador. The project seeks to empower more than 500 women from 13 communities in the departments of Chalatenango, Sonsonate, San Vicente and Usulut&#xe1;n &#x2013; where OEF has been present for more than 20 years &#x2013; to produce their own food and improve the nutrition of their families.</narrative>
  </description>
